1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,280
Calibrate the red spot position for the welding head.
校准焊接头的红点位置。

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,520
Calibrate the left or right offset.
校准左右偏移。

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:10,040
If you use the pre-installed welding nozzle for laser welding,
如果你使用预装的焊接喷嘴进行激光焊接，

4
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,800
perform a left or right offset calibration
就要进行左右偏移校准，

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,120
when the laser spot deviates left or right from the wire,
当激光光斑向焊丝左侧或右侧偏离时，

6
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,600
despite proper nozzle installation.
尽管喷嘴安装正确。

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,560
On the touch screen of the main unit,
在主机的触摸屏上，

8
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:23,360
tap System Settings, Machine Settings,
点击“系统设置”、“机器设置”，

9
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:26,120
Enter Administrator Settings.
进入“管理员设置”。

10
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:34,540
Then input the eight-digit password, 8888888.
然后输入 8 位密码 8888888。

11
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:37,980
To the right of red spot position offset, tap Start.
在“红点位置偏移”右侧，点击“开始”。

12
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:40,340
Then tap the left arrow to decrease the offset
然后点击左箭头减小偏移量，

13
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:42,380
and move the red spot leftward.
使红点向左移动。

14
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:44,740
Tap the right arrow to increase the offset
点击右箭头增大偏移量，

15
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:47,020
and move the red spot rightward.
使红点向右移动。

16
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,860
When the center of the red spot falls at the welding wire,
当红点的中心落在焊丝上时，

17
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:51,100
tap Completed.
点击“完成”。

18
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,420
Calibrate the up or down offset.
校准上下偏移。

19
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,980
When a cutting nozzle is used,
使用切割喷嘴时，

20
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,940
the laser beam may strike the nozzle's inner wall,
激光束可能会打到喷嘴内壁上，

21
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:03,260
resulting in either blockage or reflection.
导致遮挡或反射。

22
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:10,040
In such cases, perform left or right offset calibration.
在这种情况下，进行左右偏移校准。

23
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,520
If the problem persists,
如果问题仍然存在，

24
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:14,560
reset the red spot position offset to zero
把红点位置偏移重置为零，

25
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:17,480
and try calibrating the up or down offset.
再尝试校准上下偏移。

26
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:20,000
Welding and cleaning nozzles have larger apertures
焊接喷嘴和清洗喷嘴的孔径较大，

27
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,800
and typically do not require such adjustment.
通常不需要这种调整。

28
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:25,880
Insert the hex key into hole one or hole two
把内六角扳手插入 1 号孔或 2 号孔，

29
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,080
and slowly turn the screw
慢慢转动螺丝，

30
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:29,720
while observing the light emitting from the nozzle.
同时观察喷嘴射出的光。

31
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:32,920
If a clear red spot appears, stop turning the screw.
如果出现清晰的红点，就停止转动螺丝。
